    /**
     * Public top-N program suggestions for the home-page matcher
     * @description The subproject matcher (CodifyWizardController::codify) picks ONE
     * tenant to route the user into. This endpoint surfaces existing
     * Programs that match the same free-text prompt so the home page
     * can render "or follow/fork one of these" alternatives next to
     * the matched subproject — a faster path than building from scratch.
     *
     * Stage 1 only — Follow/Fork buttons on the frontend route to the
     * existing /follow-program/main/{slug}/agent flow; the follow_pivot
     * and parent_program_id tables are stage-2/3 follow-ups. No DB
     * changes required for this endpoint.
     *
     * Public (no auth) to mirror the existing GET /api/search shape so
     * a guest who lands on the home page sees suggestions without an
     * extra round-trip after login.
     */
